title: "Khwab @ Zistgah — Creative Cycler Teaser"
version: "1.0.0"
abstract: "A teaser video for the Zistgah Creative Cycler, presented under the title “Khwab @ Zistgah”. The sequence uses a period-inspired interior setting and staged characters to move between contrasting scenes, including a formal chamber, an encounter involving a masked figure and a firearm, a group of Punjabi musicians with dhol drums, and a brightly lit bedroom sequence with the central character in patterned sleepwear.The teaser presents a transformation from a dark, formal and theatrical setting into a vivid musical and dreamlike sequence. It is an audiovisual demonstration associated with the Zistgah creative-cycling concept; the video itself does not establish the underlying technical architecture or any performance claims beyond what is shown."
